          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "SPOKES\nThe Spokes node generates spokes. You have control over the size of the shape, the amount of spokes and the thickness of the spokes.\n\n- Patch Explained -\n\n• The Sine generates values from 0.1 to 0.4 to modulate the thickness of the shape.\n• The Int node creates a slider for you to select the amount of sides needed."
          }
        },
